<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>QMS 문서 정합성 검사 프로그램</title>
  <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <!-- SheetJS (xlsx) CDN -->
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/xlsx@0.18.5/dist/xlsx.full.min.js"></script>
  <!-- ExcelJS CDN (Cell Highlighting & Formatting Support) -->
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/exceljs@4.3.0/dist/exceljs.min.js"></script>
  <!-- FileSaver CDN -->
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/file-saver@2.0.5/dist/FileSaver.min.js"></script>
  <!-- JSZip CDN (여러 파일을 압축(zip)으로 묶어 다운로드하기 위함) -->
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/jszip@3.10.1/dist/jszip.min.js"></script>
  <!-- Lucide Icons CDN -->
  <script src="https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest"></script>
  <style>
    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Pretendard:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap');

    body {
      font-family: 'Pretendard', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, system-ui, Roboto, sans-serif;
      background-color: #0b1329;
      color: #f8fafc;
    }

    .glass-card {
      background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.75);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      border-radius: 1rem;
    }

    .glass-card-hover {
      transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    }

    .glass-card-hover:hover {
      border-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.5);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 30px -10px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15);
    }

    .dropzone-active {
      border-color: #3b82f6 !important;
      background-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15) !important;
    }

    /* Custom Scrollbar */
    ::-webkit-scrollbar {
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
    }

    ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
      background: #0b1329;
    }

    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
      background: #334155;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }

    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {
      background: #475569;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body class="min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-between antialiased selection:bg-blue-500 selection:text-white">

  <!-- Toast Notification Container -->
  <div id="toast-container" class="fixed bottom-5 right-5 z-50 flex flex-col space-y-2 pointer-events-none"></div>

  <!-- Navigation Header -->
  <header class="sticky top-0 z-40 bg-slate-900/90 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-slate-800/80 px-6 py-4">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto flex items-center justify-between">
      <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
        <div
          class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-blue-600 via-indigo-600 to-cyan-500 flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg shadow-blue-500/20">
          <i data-lucide="shield-check" class="w-6 h-6 text-white"></i>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
            <h1 id="txt-title"
              class="text-xl font-bold bg-gradient-to-r from-white via-slate-100 to-slate-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
              QMS 문서 정합성 검사 시스템
            </h1>
          </div>
          <p id="txt-subtitle" class="text-xs text-slate-400">관리계획서 기준 하위 문서 정합성 자동 검사 시스템</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
        <!-- Language Switcher Toggle -->
        <div
          class="inline-flex p-1 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700/80 rounded-xl text-xs font-semibold shadow-inner">
          <button id="lang-btn-kor" onclick="setLanguage('kor')"
            class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg transition-all duration-200 bg-blue-600 text-white shadow-sm cursor-pointer">
            KOR
          </button>
          <button id="lang-btn-eng" onclick="setLanguage('eng')"
            class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg transition-all duration-200 text-slate-400 hover:text-white cursor-pointer">
            ENG
          </button>
        </div>

        <button id="btn-reset" onclick="resetAll()"
          class="px-3 py-2 bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium flex items-center space-x-1.5 transition">
          <i data-lucide="rotate-ccw" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i>
          <span id="txt-reset">초기화</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Main Content Container -->
  <main class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-8 flex-grow w-full space-y-8">

    <!-- Rules & Guide Banner -->
    <div
      class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-950/60 via-slate-900 to-indigo-950/40 border border-blue-800/40 rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-xl">
      <div class="flex items-start space-x-4">
        <div class="p-3 bg-blue-500/10 rounded-xl text-blue-400 border border-blue-500/20">
          <i data-lucide="shield-check" class="w-6 h-6 text-blue-400"></i>
        </div>
        <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 space-y-2 flex-1">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-blue-200 text-base flex items-center space-x-2">
              <span id="txt-guide-title">QMS 문서 정합성 검사 가이드</span>
            </h3>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-x-6 gap-y-1.5 text-slate-400 text-xs">
            <div class="flex items-start space-x-1.5">
              <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span id="txt-guide-rule1"><b>상위 기준 문서</b>: [관리계획서] 파일을 선택하여 업로드하세요.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start space-x-1.5">
              <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span id="txt-guide-rule2"><b>검사 대상 6종 문서</b>: 검사표준서, 설비일상점검표, 스크류 점검일지, 작업조건기록지, 퍼징 작업지도서, 제습건조기 사용 관리 기준서</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 1: Upload Documents -->
    <section class="space-y-4">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
          <span
            class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-blue-600 text-white font-bold text-xs flex items-center justify-center shadow-md shadow-blue-500/30">1</span>
          <h2 id="txt-step1-title" class="text-lg font-bold text-white">문서 파일 업로드 (총 6종)</h2>
        </div>
        <span id="txt-step1-subtitle" class="text-xs text-slate-400">문서별 지원 확장자는 각 업로드 칸 아래 안내를 확인하세요.</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Document Cards Grid -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">

        <!-- 1. Control Plan (Master) -->
        <div
          class="md:col-span-3 glass-card border-blue-500/40 p-5 space-y-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-950/40 via-slate-900/60 to-slate-900/40">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
              <span
                class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-blue-500/20 border border-blue-400/30 text-blue-300 text-xs font-semibold rounded-md flex items-center space-x-1">
                <i data-lucide="crown" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-amber-400"></i>
                <span id="card-master-badge">상위 기준 문서</span>
              </span>
              <h3 id="card-title-cp" class="font-bold text-white text-base">관리계획서 (Control Plan) <span
                  class="text-red-400 font-bold ml-1">(필수)</span></h3>
            </div>
            <div id="status-cp"
              class="text-xs font-medium px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-slate-800 text-slate-400 border border-slate-700">
              미업로드
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-3">
            <label id="dropzone-cp"
              class="w-full flex-1 border-2 border-dashed border-blue-500/30 hover:border-blue-400 bg-slate-800/40 hover:bg-slate-800/80 rounded-xl p-4 cursor-pointer text-center transition">
              <input type="file" id="file-cp" accept=".xlsx,.xls,.csv" class="hidden"
                onchange="handleFileUpload('cp', event)">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-center space-x-3 text-slate-300">
                <i data-lucide="file-up" class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-400"></i>
                <span class="text-sm font-medium" id="label-cp">관리계획서 파일 선택 (엑셀, 클릭 또는 드래그앤드롭)</span>
              </div>
            </label>
            <div id="file-list-cp" class="hidden space-y-1 mt-2"></div>
            <div id="sheet-select-wrapper-cp" class="hidden min-w-[240px]">
              <label id="card-cp-sheet-lbl" class="text-xs text-slate-400 block mb-1 font-medium">적용 시트 (최신 시트
                자동선택):</label>
              <select id="sheet-select-cp" onchange="onSheetChange('cp')"
                class="w-full bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg text-xs p-2 text-slate-200 focus:outline-none focus:border-blue-500"></select>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-2" id="ext-hint-cp">※ 지원 확장자: .xlsx, .xls, .csv</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 2. Inspection Standard -->
        <div class="glass-card p-4 space-y-3 glass-card-hover">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-200 text-sm flex items-center space-x-1.5">
              <span class="text-blue-400 font-mono">01.</span>
              <span id="card-title-is">검사표준서 <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold ml-1">(선택)</span></span>
            </h4>
            <span id="status-is"
              class="text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-800 text-slate-400 border border-slate-700">미업로드</span>
          </div>
          <label id="dropzone-is"
            class="block border border-dashed border-slate-700 hover:border-slate-500 bg-slate-900/50 rounded-lg p-3 cursor-pointer text-center transition">
            <input type="file" id="file-is" accept=".xlsx,.xls,.csv" class="hidden"
              onchange="handleFileUpload('is', event)">
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 truncate block" id="label-is">파일 선택</span>
          </label>
          <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-500" id="ext-hint-is">지원 확장자: .xlsx, .xls, .csv</p>
          <div id="file-list-is" class="hidden space-y-1 mt-2"></div>
          <div id="sheet-select-wrapper-is" class="hidden">
            <select id="sheet-select-is" onchange="onSheetChange('is')"
              class="w-full bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 rounded text-xs p-1.5 text-slate-300"></select>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 3. Daily Equipment Inspection -->
        <div class="glass-card p-4 space-y-3 glass-card-hover">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-200 text-sm flex items-center space-x-1.5">
                <span class="text-blue-400 font-mono">02.</span>
                <span id="card-title-eq">설비일상점검표 <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold ml-1">(선택)</span></span>
              </h4>
              <span id="card-sub-eq" class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 block">(설비 일일 점검일지)</span>
            </div>
            <span id="status-eq"
              class="text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-800 text-slate-400 border border-slate-700">미업로드</span>
          </div>
          <label id="dropzone-eq"
            class="block border border-dashed border-slate-700 hover:border-slate-500 bg-slate-900/50 rounded-lg p-3 cursor-pointer text-center transition">
            <input type="file" id="file-eq" accept=".xlsx,.xls,.csv" class="hidden"
              onchange="handleFileUpload('eq', event)">
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 truncate block" id="label-eq">파일 선택</span>
          </label>
          <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-500" id="ext-hint-eq">지원 확장자: .xlsx, .xls, .csv</p>
          <div id="file-list-eq" class="hidden space-y-1 mt-2"></div>
          <div id="sheet-select-wrapper-eq" class="hidden">
            <select id="sheet-select-eq" onchange="onSheetChange('eq')"
              class="w-full bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 rounded text-xs p-1.5 text-slate-300"></select>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 4. Screw Inspection Log -->
        <div class="glass-card p-4 space-y-3 glass-card-hover">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-200 text-sm flex items-center space-x-1.5">
                <span class="text-blue-400 font-mono">03.</span>
                <span id="card-title-sc">스크류 점검일지 <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold ml-1">(선택)</span></span>
              </h4>
              <span id="card-sub-sc" class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 block">(스크류 점검일지)</span>
            </div>
            <span id="status-sc"
              class="text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-800 text-slate-400 border border-slate-700">미업로드</span>
          </div>
          <label id="dropzone-sc"
            class="block border border-dashed border-slate-700 hover:border-slate-500 bg-slate-900/50 rounded-lg p-3 cursor-pointer text-center transition">
            <input type="file" id="file-sc" accept=".xlsx,.xls,.csv" class="hidden"
              onchange="handleFileUpload('sc', event)">
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 truncate block" id="label-sc">파일 선택</span>
          </label>
          <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-500" id="ext-hint-sc">지원 확장자: .xlsx, .xls, .csv</p>
          <div id="file-list-sc" class="hidden space-y-1 mt-2"></div>
          <div id="sheet-select-wrapper-sc" class="hidden">
            <select id="sheet-select-sc" onchange="onSheetChange('sc')"
              class="w-full bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 rounded text-xs p-1.5 text-slate-300"></select>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 5. Work Condition Record -->
        <div class="glass-card p-4 space-y-3 glass-card-hover">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-200 text-sm flex items-center space-x-1.5">
                <span class="text-blue-400 font-mono">04.</span>
                <span id="card-title-wc">작업조건기록지 <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold ml-1">(선택)</span></span>
              </h4>
              <span id="card-sub-wc" class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 block">(셋업 & 일일 성형 조건 기록지)</span>
            </div>
            <span id="status-wc"
              class="text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-800 text-slate-400 border border-slate-700">미업로드</span>
          </div>
          <label id="dropzone-wc"
            class="block border border-dashed border-slate-700 hover:border-slate-500 bg-slate-900/50 rounded-lg p-3 cursor-pointer text-center transition">
            <input type="file" id="file-wc" accept=".xlsx,.xls,.csv" class="hidden"
              onchange="handleFileUpload('wc', event)">
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 truncate block" id="label-wc">파일 선택</span>
          </label>
          <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-500" id="ext-hint-wc">지원 확장자: .xlsx, .xls, .csv</p>
          <div id="file-list-wc" class="hidden space-y-1 mt-2"></div>
          <div id="sheet-select-wrapper-wc" class="hidden">
            <select id="sheet-select-wc" onchange="onSheetChange('wc')"
              class="w-full bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 rounded text-xs p-1.5 text-slate-300"></select>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 6. Purging Work Instruction -->
        <div class="glass-card p-4 space-y-3 glass-card-hover">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-200 text-sm flex items-center space-x-1.5">
                <span class="text-blue-400 font-mono">05.</span>
                <span id="card-title-pg">퍼징 작업지도서 <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold ml-1">(선택)</span></span>
              </h4>
              <span id="card-sub-pg" class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 block">(퍼징 작업 표준 지도서)</span>
            </div>
            <span id="status-pg"
              class="text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-800 text-slate-400 border border-slate-700">미업로드</span>
          </div>
          <label id="dropzone-pg"
            class="block border border-dashed border-slate-700 hover:border-slate-500 bg-slate-900/50 rounded-lg p-3 cursor-pointer text-center transition">
            <input type="file" id="file-pg" accept=".xlsx,.xls,.csv" class="hidden"
              onchange="handleFileUpload('pg', event)">
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 truncate block" id="label-pg">파일 선택</span>
          </label>
          <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-500" id="ext-hint-pg">지원 확장자: .xlsx, .xls, .csv</p>
          <div id="file-list-pg" class="hidden space-y-1 mt-2"></div>
          <div id="sheet-select-wrapper-pg" class="hidden">
            <select id="sheet-select-pg" onchange="onSheetChange('pg')"
              class="w-full bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 rounded text-xs p-1.5 text-slate-300"></select>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 7. Dehumidifying Dryer Usage Control Standard -->
        <div class="glass-card p-4 space-y-3 glass-card-hover">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-200 text-sm flex items-center space-x-1.5">
                <span class="text-blue-400 font-mono">06.</span>
                <span id="card-title-dd">제습건조기 사용 관리 기준서 <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold ml-1">(선택)</span></span>
              </h4>
              <span id="card-sub-dd" class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 block">(원재료 건조 조건 관리 기준서)</span>
            </div>
            <span id="status-dd"
              class="text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-800 text-slate-400 border border-slate-700">미업로드</span>
          </div>
          <label id="dropzone-dd"
            class="block border border-dashed border-slate-700 hover:border-slate-500 bg-slate-900/50 rounded-lg p-3 cursor-pointer text-center transition">
            <input type="file" id="file-dd" accept=".xlsx,.xls,.csv" class="hidden"
              onchange="handleFileUpload('dd', event)">
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 truncate block" id="label-dd">파일 선택</span>
          </label>
          <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-500" id="ext-hint-dd">지원 확장자: .xlsx, .xls, .csv</p>
          <div id="file-list-dd" class="hidden space-y-1 mt-2"></div>
          <div id="sheet-select-wrapper-dd" class="hidden">
            <select id="sheet-select-dd" onchange="onSheetChange('dd')"
              class="w-full bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 rounded text-xs p-1.5 text-slate-300"></select>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Action Button Container -->
      <div class="flex items-center justify-end pt-2">
        <button id="btn-run-analysis" onclick="runAnalysis()"
          class="px-7 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-indigo-600 hover:from-blue-500 hover:to-indigo-500 text-white font-bold rounded-xl flex items-center space-x-2 transition shadow-xl shadow-blue-600/30 cursor-pointer active:scale-95 w-full sm:w-auto justify-center">
          <i data-lucide="play" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
          <span id="txt-run-analysis">정합성 검사 시작하기</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Step 2: Dashboard Results -->
    <section id="dashboard-section" class="hidden space-y-6">

      <div
        class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-slate-800 pt-6">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
          <span
            class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-blue-600 text-white font-bold text-xs flex items-center justify-center shadow-md shadow-blue-500/30">2</span>
          <h2 id="txt-step2-title" class="text-lg font-bold text-white">정합성 검사 결과 대시보드</h2>
        </div>

        <!-- Export Action Group -->
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
          <button onclick="exportExcelWithHighlight()"
            class="px-4 py-2.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-600 to-teal-600 hover:from-emerald-500 hover:to-teal-500 text-white text-xs font-semibold rounded-xl flex items-center space-x-1.5 transition shadow-lg shadow-emerald-600/20">
            <i data-lucide="file-spreadsheet" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
            <span id="txt-export-btn">정합성 검사 결과 다운로드</span>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Metric Cards -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-8 gap-2">
        <!-- Grand Total (Total Inspection Items: Valid + Skipped) -->
        <div class="glass-card p-3 flex flex-col justify-between border-l-4 border-l-blue-500 bg-blue-950/40">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span id="metric-lbl-grand-total" class="text-[11px] text-blue-300 font-bold">총 검사 수</span>
            <i data-lucide="layers" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-blue-400"></i>
          </div>
